<title>GERMANY: Viag says 1996 oper profit higher.</title>
<headline>Viag says 1996 oper profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before tax   just under 2,400 vs 2,100</p>
<p>    Group sales			  about 42,500     vs 41,900</p>
<p>    Dividend (proposed)		12		   vs 12 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified electricity group is Viag AG. The group said the results are provisional.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
